{"steam_appid":963280,"steam_name":"Talk to Strangers","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/963280/217492/79a09647e55859811c8bd72c6e6955523bd25931/1751169784/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1683115115","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256747582/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1683115115","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/ss_cc5cc6de1d1089e00d6d1a4c9d6041bbe1c906e9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782418211","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/ss_e0b4d8aa1b765daa1a566ab0ea31f232c0e60595.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782418211","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/ss_b976aedf3c0a1f6d689087e1f1541990933c3bb3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782418211","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/ss_14b0e8e7f0e429e555e01539233463dfb51968b4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782418211","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/ss_8497589e3c3a6cce4209826675c31d904ad6b826.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782418211"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/extras/17dc93ca714cbbb2a9dd1246f3fbbdf8.poster.avif?t=1782418211\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/extras/17dc93ca714cbbb2a9dd1246f3fbbdf8.webm?t=1782418211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/extras/17dc93ca714cbbb2a9dd1246f3fbbdf8.mp4?t=1782418211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work for Sunny Morning™</strong> and sell products of the most varied natures! <br><strong>What kinds of products</strong>, you ask? Do not worry about it, your role is only to sell them. :) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/extras/86c478fb9300d7f24119840a43b5d1ed.poster.avif?t=1782418211\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/extras/86c478fb9300d7f24119840a43b5d1ed.webm?t=1782418211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/extras/86c478fb9300d7f24119840a43b5d1ed.mp4?t=1782418211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each step</strong> of the conversation can <strong>increase or decrease</strong> your Rage, Depression, and <strong>SALES! :O</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/extras/a8a933c28d3149961eaf83c39aae6571.poster.avif?t=1782418211\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/extras/a8a933c28d3149961eaf83c39aae6571.webm?t=1782418211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/extras/a8a933c28d3149961eaf83c39aae6571.mp4?t=1782418211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose carefully</strong> which house to visit at each time of the day: The <strong>mood</strong> of each potential buyer <strong>varies</strong> with time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance your spending</strong> between Motel daily costs and items that help you deal with Rage and Depression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/extras/196978f85dff302d060f8cdb528286db.poster.avif?t=1782418211\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/963280/extras/196978f85dff302d060f8cdb528286db.webm?t=1782418211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>36 DIFFERENT ENDINGS</strong> in the game!!!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Celeron 2.5ghz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 Support and 256 MB of RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1280x720 minimum resolution</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64bits<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3 2.5ghz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 3 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 2.0 Support and 256 MB of RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1280x720 minimum resolution</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Post Mortem Pixels"],"publishers":["GrabTheGames"],"release_date":"19 Apr, 2019"}